<title>NICARAGUA: Partial official results in Nicaragua's elections.</title>
<headline>Partial official results in Nicaragua's elections.</headline>
<dateline>MANAGUA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the latest official results from Nicaragua's presidential election on Sunday, released by the Supreme Electoral Council at 1045 local time (1645 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p> Arnoldo ALEMAN (Liberal Alliance)..........328,381 (48.04 pct)</p>
<p> Daniel ORTEGA (Sandinista Front)...........260,639 (39.35 pct)</p>
<p>Guillermo OSORNO (Nicaraguan Christian Way)..27,526 (3.98 pct)</p>
<p> Other 20 candidates combined:...............75,715 (10.93 pct)</p>
<p>Votes counted so far: 692,261 (35.7 percent of total)</p>
<p>Total eligible to vote: 2.4 million</p>
<p>Turnout - 80.8 percent.</p>
</text>
